Given a matrix A of N*N  interchange the diagonal elements from top to bottom and print the resultant matrix.
Input
4
5 6 7 8
13 14 15 16
1 2 3 4
9 10 11 12
Output
8 6 7 5 
13 15 14 16 
1 3 2 4 
12 10 11 9 
======
r=int(input())
A=[]
temp=0
for j in range(r):
    A.append(list(map(int,input().split())))
for i in range(r):
    A[i][i],A[i][r-i-1]=A[i][r-i-1],A[i][i]
for j in A:
    print(*j)



